  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="33a6dc22-2f95-51d1-9ff4-f671db0f7b0e" activityNameId="d74c4872-20a1-5a19-b446-e72bdfdc227c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Cathode, lithium-ion battery, lithium manganese oxide, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Cathode, lithium-ion battery, lithium manganese oxide, at plant
The dataset can be used as a cathode for a lithium-ion battery. Data are based on patents. For infrastructure, the ecoinvent dataset "chemical plant, organics" is accounted. Transportation efforts are based on ecoinvent standard estimates.;
UUID: 21aa4d8a-7ea9-34dc-b5cd-d296eac95c0c
This dataset incudes the production of a cathode for a lithium-ion battery. Active material is lithium manganese oxide, binder is LHB-108P (styrene butadiene) with the solvent water. Collector foil is aluminium, pretreated with NaOH. The collector foil is coated on 1 side with the slurry (active material, binder, solvent and conductive carbon). Then, the coated foil is dried in a "dry channel" and then coiled up. The same procedure is done for the second side of the collector foil.
Location: Some Swiss or European datasets are used for global processes.
Technology: This dataset includes a method of producing a cathode for a lithium ion battery. Spinell type lithium manganese oxide acts as a Li+-ion accumulator. Free Li+-ions move out of the spinell type LiMn2O4 (charge) to the electrolyte or from the electrolyte back to the LiMn2O4 spinell (discharge). 
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: patent, website, ecoinvent 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: Uncertainty is assessed using the pedigree matrix.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_21aa4d8a-7ea9-34dc-b5cd-d296eac95c0c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="3142d8e2-0d30-557e-b090-9faae2b72357" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">CN</shortname>
